This file contains the binary (even if it is the source)
as i COULD NOT find the solution to having it installed on releases but not on source.

IMPORTANT: The linux binary is compiled for glibc, so MUSL-Based distros will fail (such as alpine linux).

So, replace ruff with your own version here if you are on such distros.

---

However the windows ruff.exe is built for UCRT (needs Windows 10 or special runtime installer)/

So, ppm check CAN FAIL.
